<title>USA: Valley Forge sets stock and cash dividends.</title>
<headline>Valley Forge sets stock and cash dividends.</headline>
<dateline>SAN RAFAEL, Calif. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valley Forge Corp said Tuesday it declared set a 50 percent stock dividend and a regular quarterly dividend of $0.06 a share on pre-split shares.</p>
<p>Both the stock and cash dividends are payable September 16, record September 5.</p>
<p>Valley Froge said it anticipates the next quarterly dividend will be $0.04 a share, to reflect the 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
</text>
